| Bug fix | `bugfix-debug` |

## Quality bar

- TypeScript strict; avoid `any`.
- Minimal diff; no drive-by refactors.
- Do not edit plan files (`.cursor/plans/`) unless user asks.
- Git: commit only when user explicitly requests.

